          "height": 1325,
          "src": "/assets/img/tei-topphammare-3.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "TE1000 and TE1000 in cross-section"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "TEI drills designed to deliver the power required for efficient soil nailing, micropiles and other drilling applications in hard rock and soil."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "By integrating the in-house developed ASA technology (Automatic Stroke Adjustment) in the percussion system, productivity and the service life of the equipment are increased, as are profitability. The ASA system adjusts the power output to varying soil and rock conditions."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "TEI’s drills produce full impact power only when the drill string is engaged and reduce stroke length and frequency when idling, which minimises energy loss and prevents unnecessary wear on the components."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "With their compact size and leading power-to-weight ratio, TEI’s drills stand out in the market."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "See the range of TEI’s drifters below. Further down there is a table with the technical specifications."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<a href=\"/kontakta-oss\">Contact us</a> for more information."
        },
