          "layout": "bars",
          "unit": "mm",
          "title": "Which drifter fits your hole size?",
          "intro": "Each model covers a range of hole sizes. Find your size on the scale and pick a model whose bar covers it. Where the bars overlap several models fit, so choose by power, torque and weight (see the table further down).",
